@base_url = http://localhost:8000/api/v1
@slug_poli = poli_mata


### list poli
GET {{base_url}}/poli-data
Content-Type: application/json

### master vaksin
GET {{base_url}}/master/vaksin
Content-Type: application/json

### check nik
POST {{base_url}}/patients/check-nik
Content-Type: application/json

{"nik": "3578012345670001"}


### cek jadwal poli
GET {{base_url}}/poli/{{slug_poli}}/schedules?date=2026-09-07
Content-Type: application/json


### WA gateway — status & QR
GET http://localhost:3001/status
Content-Type: application/json

### WA gateway — QR image
GET http://localhost:3001/qr-image
Content-Type: application/json

### WA gateway — send test (header X-API-KEY harus sama dengan WA_API_KEY)
POST http://localhost:3001/send
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-KEY: changeme

{
    "to": "082140300286",
    "message": "Test WA gateway — delay 3s"
}

### Registration
POST {{base_url}}/registration
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "patient_id": 153125,
    "patient_nik": "3578012345670001",
    "jadwal_id": 1,
    "poli_id": "poli_mata",
    "kodePoli": "MAT",
    "doctor_id": 11,
    "doctorName": "dr. H. M. Sjarifudhin, Sp. M., M.M.R",
    "poliName": "Poli Mata",
    "practiceHours": "16:00 - 19:00",
    "date": "2026-09-07",
    "payment_method": "umum",
    "responsible_name": "John Doe",
    "responsible_phone": "081234567890"
}

### Registration — Poli Vaksin (id_vaksin wajib)
POST {{base_url}}/registration
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "patient_id": 153125,
    "patient_nik": "3578012345670001",
    "jadwal_id": 2,
    "poli_id": "poli_vaksin",
    "kodePoli": "VKS",
    "doctor_id": 11,
    "doctorName": "dr. Vaksin",
    "poliName": "Poli Vaksin",
    "practiceHours": "08:00 - 12:00",
    "date": "2026-09-24",
    "payment_method": "umum",
    "id_vaksin": "1",
    "responsible_name": "John Doe",
    "responsible_phone": "081234567890"
}

### Queue status — non-BPJS (kdantrian)
GET {{base_url}}/registrations/XXXXXXXXXXXXXXX
Content-Type: application/json

### Queue status — BPJS (kodebooking)
GET {{base_url}}/registrations/XXXXXXXXXXXXXXX
Content-Type: application/json